#
# Device Information:
# - Model: TCM220063 (Tchibo/TCM brand)  
# - Frequency: 433.92 MHz
# - Protocol: Nexus-TH (Nexus Weather Protocol)
# - Transmission Interval: Every 60 seconds
# - Supported by Weather Station app v1.8+
#
# Data Format (Nexus-TH Protocol):
# - 36 bits total: 12-bit preamble + 4-bit sync + 32-bit data
# - Channel: 4 bits (0-2, usually 0)
# - Rolling ID: 8 bits (changes on battery replacement)  
# - Temperature: 12 bits signed (0.1°C resolution, +40°C offset)
# - Humidity: 8 bits (0-100% range)
